+
 ### `Fixed`
 
 - Changed endors.py license from GPL to MIT (♥ to @aidaanva for fixing)
@@ -15,6 +17,7 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](http://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.
